# UngovernedReportEmpty: an ungoverned report has every count zero.
MODULE: SchemaComplianceScan
ROW: UngovernedReportEmpty
FILE: src/lattice.schema/LatticeSchemaComplianceReport.cs
DETECTORS: LatticeSchemaComplianceReportTests.Ungoverned_reports_no_policy_and_all_zero_counts
SUMMARY: an ungoverned report carries a rule count

--- FIND
            ScannedCount = 0,
            RuleBreakdown = ReadOnlyCollection<LatticeSchemaComplianceRuleCount>.Empty,
        };
--- REPLACE
            ScannedCount = 0,
            RuleBreakdown = ReadOnlyCollection<LatticeSchemaComplianceRuleCount>.Empty,
            RuleCount = 1,
        };
--- END
